---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Catering">
  <div class="page-content">
    <h1>Catering</h1>

    <p>
      As well as our café and bakery on the ANU campus at 105 Ellery
      Crescent, we cater for events. We have experience catering for
      small and larger groups. From a working lunch to a high-class
      dinner, we have you covered.
    </p>

    <div class="two-col">
      <div>
        <h2>What we cater for</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Corporate events</li>
          <li>Private functions</li>
          <li>Morning teas</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>Get in touch</h2>
        <p>
          Get in touch with us so we can design your next event — email
          is preferred:
          <a href="mailto:catering@savoirfrench.com.au"
            >catering@savoirfrench.com.au</a
          >. Please include the location, number of people, dietary
          requirements, and the day &amp; time, and let us do the rest.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="entrance-note">
      <strong>Please note</strong> we make everything in-house, so we
      can't accept last-minute requests. We require a minimum of 72
      hours' notice for small orders, and up to a week for larger
      orders. There's a minimum spend of $400 for a catering order to be
      delivered — no minimum spend for a pick-up order.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="carousel-section">
    <ul class="carousel">
      <li>
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608897013039-887f21d8c804?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60"
          alt="Placeholder catering canapé plates — not an actual photo of Savoir French"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1488477181946-6428a0291777?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60"
          alt="Placeholder catering dessert tray — not an actual photo of Savoir French"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1452195100486-9cc805987862?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60"
          alt="Placeholder cheese and baguette platter — not an actual photo of Savoir French"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555244162-803834f70033?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60"
          alt="Placeholder catering table set-up — not an actual photo of Savoir French"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Layout>
